<h1>What's new</h1>

<p>We release each new feature and fix to the <a href="/help/beta-channel/">beta</a> as soon as it's ready, so every change gets its own version. The main app gets them in batches, once they've settled in on the beta, so it can jump several versions at once.</p>

<p>This page lists what's changed in the version you're using over the last six months, newest first.</p>

{% for month in whatsNew %}
<h2>{{ month.month }}</h2>
<ul>
  {%- for release in month.releases %}{% for change in release.changes %}
  <li>{{ change }} <span class="block text-sm text-muted tabular-nums">{{ release.day }} · {{ release.version }}</span></li>
  {%- endfor %}{% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<p>Nothing to show yet.</p>
{% endfor %}
